sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    App->>Node: GapCentral.GetBondInformation()
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.BondInformationReceived(<br>currentBonds=2,<br>maxBonds=8,<br>bonds=[{addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress}, deviceName="DeviceA"},<br>{addressWithType={address=00:1A:7D:DA:71:13, addressType=publicAddress}, deviceName="DeviceB"}],<br>persisted=true)

    Note over App: Select specific bond to remove by identity address or device name 

    App->>Node: GapCentral.RemoveBondWithAddress(<br>address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress)
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)

    Note over App: Verify remaining bonds

    App->>Node: GapCentral.GetBondInformation()
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.BondInformationReceived(<br>currentBonds=1,<br>maxBonds=8,<br>bonds=[{addressWithType={address=00:1A:7D:DA:71:13, addressType=publicAddress}, deviceName="DeviceB"}],<br>persisted=false)
